name=Fitted Barricades
id=FittedBarricades
description=Makes barricades fit the window or door they're nailed to, and take the material to match. Vanilla planks, sheet metal and metal bars all cover the same small band whatever they're on, so on a tall window, a shop front or a door most of the opening stays open, and four planks are all it will ever take. With this mod the barricade covers the whole opening - up to nine planks, a second metal sheet, a second set of bars - and is as strong as that much material should be. Every plank is a real plank: vanilla health, refunds, saves and multiplayer.
